# What Matte's SHARP generator needs (matte_sharp.py and spatial\sharp). Matte installs the locked lists made from
# this, wheels only (nothing is built on the user's machine; rectpack, which has no wheel, is in spatial\rectpack):
# requirements-cpu.txt (default) or requirements-cu128.txt (NVIDIA acceleration). To remake them:
#   uv pip compile requirements.in --torch-backend cpu   --python-version 3.12 --python-platform x86_64-pc-windows-msvc --generate-hashes --only-binary :all: --exclude-newer <date> -o requirements-cpu.txt
#   uv pip compile requirements.in --torch-backend cu128 --python-version 3.12 --python-platform x86_64-pc-windows-msvc --generate-hashes --only-binary :all: --exclude-newer <date> -o requirements-cu128.txt
